It is April in Berlin.
Spring is here, but the weather is constantly changing.
Today it is cold and grey.
It is Wednesday morning and I wake up.
I open my eyes, but I do not feel good at all.
I try to swallow.
My throat hurts terribly.
I try to sit up.
But my head hurts too.
My whole body is heavy.
I am lying under the blanket, but I am very cold.
I look at the clock on the bedside table.
It is seven o'clock and I am actually supposed to get up.
But I stay in bed because I am sick.
I absolutely cannot go to the office today.
I am staying in the flat because I need rest.
I take my phone.
I have to inform my colleagues.
